{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate that Previous Employers Provide References for Ofsted-Regulated Roles",
        "additional_details": "Many employers require references for Ofsted-regulated roles. Some former employers refuse to provide them, unfairly preventing suitable people from finding work. We believe the law should require employers to provide a fair, factual reference.",
        "background": "Require employers to provide factual references for former employees applying for Ofsted-regulated roles. Ban employers from withholding references as retaliation or unfairly blocking access to future employment.",
